    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for the agentic scraper plugin. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Lifecycle:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Call initialize(config) — returns false on invalid config.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Call <ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_i_scraper_plugin_1a83a7b4d6c73e6deebf9f137ecb28762f" kindref="member">scrape()</ref> — blocks until the run completes.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Inspect <ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_i_scraper_plugin_1a5731691f97222f46171b38c6f213e302" kindref="member">getResults()</ref> for the accepted documents.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Call <ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_i_scraper_plugin_1a5ba37c7fc611bd0e4b882949f221a82f" kindref="member">reset()</ref> before reusing the same instance with a new config. </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
